  "Luxembourg has a negative trade balance with its top trading partners in 2025.",
  "The total trade balance is -9.78 billion euros, indicating more imports than exports overall.",
  "Belgium is the largest partner with a trade deficit of -5.40 billion euros, followed by Germany at -2.35 billion euros and Japan at -1.07 billion euros.",
